Subject: [M156] [a11y] Copy children when marking unincluded subtrees dirty

Original change's description:
> [a11y] Copy children when marking unincluded subtrees dirty
>
> MarkAXSubtreeDirtyWithCleanLayout() walks an unincluded object's
> children_ and marks each included child dirty. Updating cached values
> on those children can update the tree and come back to clear or rebuild
> the object's children_ while the outer loop is still walking it.
>
> This CL copies ChildrenIncludingIgnored() into a local HeapVector before
> looping in MarkAXSubtreeDirtyWithCleanLayout(), and skips children that
> detached during an earlier iteration.
>
> This loop only runs on unincluded objects, and outside of nested updates
> the behavior is unchanged.
>
